WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.035
Today your child reads sentences, and then a story.

2
00:00:03.485 --> 00:00:05.101
These are today's two pages.

3
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:11.231
Here is the one rule for today. If one of the two letters goes wrong, do not stop your child.

4
00:00:11.681 --> 00:00:15.478
Wait until the end of the sentence. Then say: check with the bed.

5
00:00:15.928 --> 00:00:19.566
Let your child find it. Finding it is worth more than being told.

6
00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:26.485
Your child reads each sentence twice. Then copies the first one, saying the helper out loud while writing.

7
00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:31.203
Then turn to the story. Every word in it is one your child can sound out.

8
00:00:31.653 --> 00:00:35.553
Let them read it to you. Then let them read it to someone else in the family.
